      "text": "[7:11AM] #Ogba\n#Ojodu\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nAside from slight alternation delay at Odo Eran, traffic is good coming from Oba Ogunji road to connect Ijaiye road/Ogunusi road enroute Ogba bus stop, Omole round about down to Berger.\n\nThe return journey from Berger back to Ogba and Odo Eran is also good.\n\nWemco road is also good to go.\n#FollowLASTMA",
