      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1937778876488269923",
      "text": "[8:08AM]  #FunsoWilliamsAvenue\n#EkoBridge\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nDorman-long  bridge inward Ojuelegba is busy due to the morning rush.\nOjuelegba bridge inward Barracks is a better movement.\n  Barracks inward Stadium very good to go.\n\nStadium inward  Alaka is good on both lanes as well.\n\nAlaka inward Costain is good.\nEko bridge all the way to Apongbon is a  steady movement due to morning vehicular influx .\n\nReturn journey from Eko bridge to Alaka and Stadium both main carriage way and on the service lane are still good to go.\n\nEko bridge descending to Costain and  Apapa road connecting Nigerian Breweries looks good.\n\nBarracks on the main carriage way, Ojuelegba inward Dorman-long bridge is also looking good.\n#FollowLASTMA",
